1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,233
Ma una centrale

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,321
nucleare può esplodere

3
00:00:02,321 --> 00:00:03,061
come una bomba

4
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:03,840
atomica?

5
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,120
No

6
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,294
E non perché qualcuno

7
00:00:06,294 --> 00:00:07,250
la tiene a bada

8
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,900
lo impedisce la fisica

9
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,740
In una bomba

10
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,850
l'uranio 235

11
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:13,960
è quasi puro

12
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,446
più di 90 nuclei

13
00:00:15,446 --> 00:00:16,260
su 100

14
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,920
Ogni neutrone

15
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,600
anche se velocissimo

16
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,432
trova subito

17
00:00:20,432 --> 00:00:21,710
un nucleo da spaccare

18
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,392
e in meno

19
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:23,379
di un milionesimo

20
00:00:23,379 --> 00:00:24,020
di secondo

21
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:24,612
si libera

22
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:25,800
tutta l'energia

23
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,634
Per una centrale

24
00:00:29,634 --> 00:00:30,440
nucleare

25
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:31,366
è completamente

26
00:00:31,366 --> 00:00:32,130
diverso

27
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,098
Nella pastiglia

28
00:00:34,098 --> 00:00:35,365
di una centrale

29
00:00:35,365 --> 00:00:36,069
infatti

30
00:00:36,069 --> 00:00:37,126
l'uranio 235

31
00:00:37,126 --> 00:00:38,393
è solo da 3 a 5

32
00:00:38,393 --> 00:00:39,820
nuclei su 100

33
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,680
Tutti gli altri

34
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,140
sono uranio 238

35
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,240
e molti neutroni

36
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,180
finiscono lì

37
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,270
assorbiti

38
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:47,898
Per andare avanti

39
00:00:47,898 --> 00:00:48,547
la reazione

40
00:00:48,547 --> 00:00:49,960
ha bisogno dell'acqua

41
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:50,588
che rallenta

42
00:00:50,588 --> 00:00:51,320
i neutroni

43
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,506
E i neutroni

44
00:00:52,506 --> 00:00:53,810
più sono lenti

45
00:00:53,890 --> 00:00:54,894
più probabilità

46
00:00:54,894 --> 00:00:56,121
hanno di interagire

47
00:00:56,121 --> 00:00:57,480
con l'uranio 235

48
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,240
E se il nocciolo

49
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,301
si scalda troppo

50
00:01:00,301 --> 00:01:01,417
l'acqua si dilata

51
00:01:01,417 --> 00:01:02,254
e frena meno

52
00:01:02,254 --> 00:01:03,280
i neutroni

53
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:04,380
la reazione

54
00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:05,630
rallenta da sola

55
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:07,241
Un incidente

56
00:01:07,241 --> 00:01:08,576
è molto improbabile

57
00:01:08,576 --> 00:01:10,030
ma può succedere

58
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,134
ma un'esplosione

59
00:01:11,134 --> 00:01:11,678
atomica

60
00:01:11,678 --> 00:01:12,548
è fisicamente

61
00:01:12,548 --> 00:01:13,610
impossibile

62
00:01:14,310 --> 00:01:15,490
Hai qualche domanda?

63
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:16,970
Fammela nei commenti!

